{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"40d33eda8b5b9495c6552d195c4506c16703cdb4559e31121f0f3e7c551ec748","ja":"気持ちは伝わる","zh":"心意相通","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"76f5e61905c44905021cc24b31988d9fe71b9a5629dbd1d94930bb6b32333a45","ja":"だって、この映画のいいところはいっぱいあるんだし、\nそれを伝えるにはいっぱい話さないと……。","zh":"毕竟这部电影有那么多优点，\n想传达出来的话，就必须要说好多好多……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"22f233b32de42d671bff0945ea2d1e6f343a82beaeaa557378833432cf0795e4","ja":"そうかな？　この前の宣伝の時だって、\n最後まで説明、出来てなかったけど……。","zh":"是吗？上次宣传的时候，\n不也是没能说明到最后吗……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"72595ebbcbc08f3a802e565e0471e15ea4691c0f1bc6c3c78c231c7c77554762","ja":"楽しそうに話してる百合子を見てるだけで、\nすっごく面白そうな映画だなって感じたよ。","zh":"光是看着百合子聊得那么开心，\n我就觉得那肯定是一部非常有趣的电影。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a0a3f2753d2df04b3a960bf484441314b22e182081618b87920ae77dab000b91","ja":"そうね。きっと見てる人も、\n同じように感じたんじゃないかな？","zh":"是啊。想必观看的人，\n也产生了同样的感受吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7a1a07ca7867d4f525e52c8213fbd1ec303900f756485fdd3f84d362aaea489c","ja":"そ、そう言ってもらえるのはすごく嬉しいですけど、\nやっぱり……。","zh":"能、能听到您这么说我真的很高兴，\n但还是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c2134ebde5e99b0d8c3681958376264108d809a0e6b69a9d28681c4f99e389ad","ja":"実は私も、この前の百合子ちゃんを見てたら、\n映画をまた見返したくなっちゃったの。","zh":"其实我看到前些天的百合子之后，\n也变得很想重温一下那部电影呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b30521b52223dedbb5dc33262a86da40445b3f606a745bd69c4fb5b25d6d58b5","ja":"そうですね。百合子さんから、\nこの映画に対する熱い気持ちが伝わってきました。","zh":"是啊。我也感受到了\n百合子对这部电影的热切心意。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"caf044948de0d53604835322c4eebfc938544b67bf50640835f6181060f13177","ja":"そうなんだ……えへへ♪","zh":"是这样啊……嘿嘿♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"7ceb379dfc84cae37e8fc97680a41bbf3685667b05d6fba9ebc21d104767d903","ja":"みんなにそう言ってもらえたら、\n短くてもうまく伝えられる気がしてきました！","zh":"大家这么一说，\n我就觉得即便简短，应该也能好好表达出来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"5e47cc9650d5126e3fcf68ea9b8a272f11e80912770d666a4ba399cee4ccfa13","ja":"じゃあ急いで台本をなおして……ううん、\n台本は用意しない方が良いかな。","zh":"那我赶紧改一下剧本……不对，\n还是不准备剧本比较好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"52596c7d1037fa1a9472dcb7280a0b0075d0af02f48d9b2b3b61d43842ec4cd4","ja":"そうだね、その方が気持ちがこもって、\n見てる人に伝わると思う。","zh":"说得对呢，那样会更加倾注心意，\n也能更好地传达给观看的人。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1358.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"a12653aedf924c4223e83215e936b11c03cbf81527d3c62f4a0c3cdb1fb4a59b","ja":"はい！　それじゃあ本番、行きましょう！","zh":"好的！那么正式演出，我们上吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
